	quest.7E3A9E93F37A9D18.quest_desc: [
		"  The &4&lFusion Reactor&r&r is an extremely advanced power source designed for late-game energy production."
		"   Using nuclear fusion, it generates an enormous amount of power capable of running entire factory systems and high-tier machines with ease."
		"  Unlike the Fusion Reactor, which works by splitting atoms, the Fusion Reactor creates energy by fusing them together under extreme temperatures."
		"  Once the reaction becomes stable, the reactor can continuously produce massive amounts of energy with incredible efficiency."
		"  Building and maintaining a Fusion Reactor requires &badvanced infrastructure&r, a steady fuel supply, and proper system management to keep the reaction stable and running smoothly."
	]
